WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
This is STEMhop. It is a free place to learn science, one short lesson at a time.

2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.950
Today that means biology, from age 5 to graduate school, with more sciences on the

3
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.870
way. No account needed, no ads.

4
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.590
A lesson is a short reading.

5
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.470
Nearly every one has a short film, most have a simulation you can change, and

6
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.450
practice questions explain their answers.

7
00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:29.853
Every lesson explains its idea at more than one level.

8
00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:34.873
When one loses you, hop down a level, get the idea, and hop back up.

9
00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:40.087
Parents can start with 30 hands-on activities for ages 5 to 10.

10
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.380
Teachers can paste in a syllabus and see matching lessons, without sending it

11
00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:46.380
anywhere.

12
00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:52.333
AI helps make the lessons, and a person has not yet read every one, so each has a

13
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.393
button to report a mistake.

14
00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:57.187
Start wherever you are, at stemhop.com.
